<div id="ribbon-Home" class="ribbon-page">
 <div class="ribbon-group"><div class="group-tools"><button id="cmd-tool-0" data-action="tool" data-value="0" title="Selecionar · 1"><img src="icon-select"/>Selecionar</button><button id="cmd-tool-1" data-action="tool" data-value="1" title="Mover · 2"><img src="icon-move"/>Mover</button><button id="cmd-tool-2" data-action="tool" data-value="2" title="Escalar · 3"><img src="icon-scale"/>Escalar</button><button id="cmd-tool-3" data-action="tool" data-value="3" title="Girar · 4"><img src="icon-rotate"/>Girar</button></div><div class="group-name">Transformar</div></div>
 <div class="ribbon-group"><div class="group-tools"><button id="cmd-part-" data-action="part" title="Inserir bloco ancorado"><img src="icon-part"/>Peça</button><button data-action="sphere"><img src="icon-sphere"/>Esfera</button><button data-action="spawn"><img src="icon-spawn"/>Nascimento</button></div><div class="group-name">Inserir</div></div>
 <div class="ribbon-group"><div class="group-tools"><button data-action="color-dialog"><img src="icon-color"/>Cor</button><button data-action="material-dialog"><img src="icon-material"/>Material</button><button data-action="anchor" title="Alternar ancoragem da peça selecionada"><img src="icon-anchor"/>Ancorar</button></div><div class="group-name">Aparência / física</div></div>
 <div class="ribbon-group"><div class="group-tools"><button data-action="show:settings"><img src="icon-settings"/>Configurações</button><button id="cmd-show:audio-" data-action="show:audio"><img src="icon-audio"/>Áudio</button><button data-action="show:assets"><img src="icon-image"/>Imagens</button></div><div class="group-name">Projeto</div></div>
</div>
<div id="ribbon-Model" class="ribbon-page">
 <div class="ribbon-group"><div class="group-tools"><label class="handle-size"><span>Grade</span><select id="grid-mode" data-action="grid-mode" title="Incremento: arredonda deslocamento. Absoluta: arredonda posição no eixo ativo."><option value="relative">Incremento</option><option value="absolute">Absoluta</option></select></label><label class="handle-size"><span>Encaixe · Ctrl</span><select id="snap-feature" data-action="snap-feature" title="Caixas: posiciona livremente na face sob o cursor. Esferas não suportam este modo."><option value="face">Face</option><option value="edge">Borda</option><option value="vertex">Vértice</option></select></label><label class="handle-size" title="Opcional: gira o eixo Y da seleção até a normal da face"><span>Alinhar à normal</span><input id="snap-align" data-action="snap-align" type="checkbox"/></label></div><div class="group-name">Construção</div></div>
 <div class="ribbon-group"><div class="group-tools"><button data-action="folder"><img src="icon-folder"/>Pasta</button><button data-action="model"><img src="icon-model"/>Modelo</button><button data-action="group" title="Ctrl+G"><img src="icon-model"/>Agrupar</button><button data-action="ungroup" title="Ctrl+Shift+G"><img src="icon-model"/>Desagrupar</button></div><div class="group-name">Organizar</div></div>
 <div class="ribbon-group"><div class="group-tools"><button data-action="duplicate" title="Duplicar · Ctrl+D"><img src="icon-duplicate"/>Duplicar</button><button data-action="copy" title="Copiar · Ctrl+C"><img src="icon-copy"/>Copiar</button><button data-action="paste" title="Colar · Ctrl+V"><img src="icon-paste"/>Colar</button><button data-action="delete"><img src="icon-delete"/>Excluir</button></div><div class="group-name">Editar</div></div>
 <div class="ribbon-group"><div class="group-tools"><button data-action="focus" title="Enquadrar seleção · F"><img src="icon-focus"/>Foco</button><button data-action="show:assets"><img src="icon-image"/>Imagens</button></div><div class="group-name">Superfície</div></div>
</div>
<div id="ribbon-Avatar" class="ribbon-page">
 <div class="ribbon-group"><div class="group-tools"><button id="cmd-r6-" data-action="r6"><img src="icon-rig"/>Personagem</button><button id="cmd-show:rig-" data-action="show:rig"><img src="icon-rig"/>Editar rig</button><button id="cmd-show:animation-" data-action="show:animation"><img src="icon-animation"/>Animar</button></div><div class="group-name">Ferramentas de personagem</div></div>
 <div class="ribbon-group"><div class="group-tools"><button data-action="show:settings"><img src="icon-settings"/>Jogador</button></div><div class="group-name">Configuração</div></div>
</div>
<div id="ribbon-Script" class="ribbon-page">
 <div class="ribbon-group"><div class="group-tools"><button id="cmd-script-" data-action="script"><img src="icon-script"/>Script</button><button data-action="local-script"><img src="icon-local-script"/>Local</button><button data-action="module"><img src="icon-module"/>Módulo</button></div><div class="group-name">Inserir Lua 5.4</div></div>
 <div class="ribbon-group"><div class="group-tools"><button id="script-examples" data-action="script-examples"><img src="icon-script"/>Exemplos</button><button data-action="show:script"><img src="icon-script"/>Editor</button><button data-action="show:output"><img src="icon-output"/>Saída</button></div><div class="group-name">Código</div></div>
</div>
<div id="ribbon-View" class="ribbon-page">
 <div class="ribbon-group"><div class="group-tools"><label class="handle-size"><span>Qualidade 3D</span><select id="render-quality" data-action="render-quality" title="Médio: luz por pixel e sombras. Alto: PBR leve e MSAA 4×. Baixo: sem sombras. Compatível: aparência anterior."><option value="legacy">Compatível</option><option value="low">Baixo</option><option value="medium" selected="selected">Médio</option><option value="high">Alto · PBR leve</option></select></label><label class="handle-size"><span>Antialiasing</span><select id="render-aa" data-action="render-aa" title="Suavização da cena 3D. MSAA 4× usa FXAA se indisponível."><option value="auto" selected="selected">Automático</option><option value="off">Desligado</option><option value="fxaa">FXAA</option><option value="msaa4">MSAA 4×</option></select></label></div><div class="group-name">Visual</div></div>
 <div class="ribbon-group"><div class="group-tools"><button id="editor-edges" data-action="editor-edges" title="Arestas de depuração · F8. Desativadas por padrão; respeitam paredes e não aparecem no Player."><img src="icon-part"/>Arestas</button></div><div class="group-name">Depuração</div></div>
 <div class="ribbon-group"><div class="group-tools"><button data-action="toggle-toolbox"><img src="icon-toolbox"/>Ferramentas</button><button data-action="toggle-explorer"><img src="icon-explorer"/>Explorador</button><button data-action="toggle-properties"><img src="icon-properties"/>Propriedades</button><button data-action="show:output"><img src="icon-output"/>Saída</button></div><div class="group-name">Painéis</div></div>
 <div class="ribbon-group"><div class="group-tools"><button data-action="reset-layout"><img src="icon-respawn"/>Restaurar</button><button data-action="focus"><img src="icon-focus"/>Foco</button><button id="show-collision-shapes" data-action="collision-shapes" title="Mostrar colisões · ciano: Bullet; magenta: divergência; amarelo: seleção"><img src="icon-part"/>Colisores</button></div><div class="group-name">Mundo</div></div>
 <div class="ribbon-group"><div class="group-tools"><label class="handle-size"><span>Tamanho das alças</span><select id="gizmo-size" data-action="gizmo-size"><option value="1">100%</option><option value="1.25">125%</option><option value="1.5">150%</option><option value="0.85">85%</option></select></label></div><div class="group-name">Alças</div></div>
</div>
<div id="ribbon-Game" class="ribbon-page">
 <div class="ribbon-group"><div class="group-tools"><button data-action="play"><img src="icon-play"/>Executar</button><button data-action="stop"><img src="icon-stop"/>Parar</button></div><div class="group-name">Testar</div></div>
 <div class="ribbon-group"><div class="group-tools"><button id="cmd-show:settings-" data-action="show:settings"><img src="icon-settings"/>Config</button><button data-action="save"><img src="icon-save"/>Salvar</button><button data-action="save-dialog"><img src="icon-save"/>Salvar como</button></div><div class="group-name">Projeto</div></div>
</div>
